TemperatureList[K]                    500 600 700 800 900 1000 1125 1250 1375 1500 1650 1800 2000 2250 2500
PressureList[atm]                     0.013   1.   100.

### Method Parameters ###
CalculationMethod                     direct         

### Energy Grid Parameters ###
EnergyStepOverTemperature             0.2            
ExcessEnergyOverTemperature           60             ! ratio of the highest energy barrier in the model to T 
                                                     
ModelEnergyLimit[kcal/mol]            500            ! highest reference energy used in calculation[kcal/mol]，default value=400                                                                                             

### Cutoff Parameters ###
!TunnelingActionCutoff                50             ! default value=40；tunneling  coefficient is set to 0 when tunneling action is bigger than this value 
WellCutoff                            10                                                                
ChemicalEigenvalueMax                 1              ! Max chemical eigenvalue
ChemicalEigenvalueMin                 1.e-8          ! The default value is 1E-7；only for direct diagonalization method

### Output Parameters ###
RateOutput                            indeneO2.out
LogOutput                             indeneO2.log 
!OutputTemperatureStep[K]              100
!OutputTemperatureSize                 24
!OutputReferenceEnergy[kcal/mol]       0.


#######################
Model                 
#######################
